-- title:
--   The call loop (round six, `cLoopR_sp`)
-- statement:
--   **The call loop** (general register sequence): `W k` the registers before step `k`, `W' k`
--   after the call of step `k` (which sets `11 := f k`).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegILPre6`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.PreT.cLoopR_sp {r : Fin HS} (hr : r ∈ rg) (hr12 : r ≠ 12) (s : IState HS) (v : Fin HS → ℤ) (c : Fin HS → List ℤ) {O : Fin HS} (hO : O ∉ rg)
--       (hO5 : O.val < 56) (hOC : O ≠ Cu) (hc : c Cu = []) {cl : RS} (hw : Cu ∉ cl.writes)
--       {A N : ℕ} (hA : 2 ≤ A) (hv : VB v A) (h24 : v r = N) (hN : N ≤ 2 ^ A) (f : ℕ → ℤ)
--       (W W' : ℕ → Fin HS → ℤ) (hW0 : W 0 = Function.update v 12 0)
--       (hWs : ∀ k, W (k + 1) = Function.update (W' k) 12 (k + 1))
--       (hW11 : ∀ k < N, W' k 11 = f k) (hW12 : ∀ k < N, W' k 12 = k)
--       (hWV : ∀ k < N, VB (W' k) A) {Cc : ℕ}
--       (hcl : ∀ k < N, ∀ cc : Fin HS → List ℤ,
--         Sp cl (encK s (J6Seg.PreT.RF (W k) cc)) (encK s (J6Seg.PreT.RF (W' k) cc)) Cc) :
--       Sp (cLoopR O cl r) (encK s (J6Seg.PreT.RF v c)) (encK s (J6Seg.PreT.RF (W N) (Function.update c O (rv f N ++ c O))))
--         (J6Seg.PreT.cE (.lit 0) (BW A) + (2 * 2000 * (BW A + 2) + N * (Cc + J6Seg.PreT.cE (.reg 11) (BW A) +
--           J6Seg.PreT.cE (.add (.reg 12) (.lit 1)) (BW A) + 8000 * (BW A + 2) + 30) + 32))
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** B-line IL, pre-tables (B5), part 6: the call loop
--
--   `cLoop O cl` = `U := 0; repeat N = v 24 times { cl; push X on O; U := U + 1 }` where the call `cl`
--   sets `X = v 11 := f U`. `cLoop_sp`: it pushes `f 0, …, f (N-1)` onto `O` (so `O` gains `rv f N`);
--   the registers end as `wS v f N` (only `11, 12` change).
